  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="80a8e839-f2a0-5b5b-abe7-d553c70d1169" activityNameId="3344b2b3-b25a-584d-aa32-7c7c7881cd51" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Anaerobic digestion plant covered, agriculture</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Anaerobic digestion plant covered, agriculture
The inventory refers to a typical agricultural biogas plant with a capacity of 500m3 and a life time of 20 years.;
Synonyms: agricultural co-fermentation plant; 
UUID: 347ed683-5807-3670-862c-3f13e15cd3f5
The process includes the production, transport and disposal of the main materials for an agricultural biogas plant.
Location: This process refers to an agricultural biogas plant with a capacity of about 500m3. The data were sampled from 20 different plants in Switzerland.   
Technology: To avoid Methane emissions the new plants in Switzerland are covered.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 70 plants
Sampling: The data are the average of 20 from 70 plants in Switzerland 
Extrapolations: no extrapolation was necessary because the typical plants for the region and time period were evaluated
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_347ed683-5807-3670-862c-3f13e15cd3f5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">CH</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: This process refers to an agricultural biogas plant with a capacity of about 500m3. The data were sampled from 20 different plants in Switzerland.   </text>
        </comment>
      </geography>
      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: To avoid Methane emissions the new plants in Switzerland are covered.</text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
